# Private working files. These used to be hidden from Prettier by the .gitignore
# that sat here back when this package WAS the repository root — Prettier reads
# .gitignore by default, but only the one in its working directory. The rules now
# live in the root .gitignore re-anchored as `packages/cli/todo/*`, which Prettier
# never sees when `format`/`format:check` run from this directory. Restating them
# here keeps `prettier --check .` agreeing with git from either place.
